1.1.0
Adobe Commerce 2.4.9 stack

Changes since 1.0.0
- targeted the stack at Adobe Commerce 2.4.9 system requirements
- bumped nginx to 1.30 (added images/nginx/1.30)
- bumped MariaDB to 12.3
- bumped RabbitMQ to 4.2
- added Valkey 9 (cache/session backend for 2.4.9); kept Redis as legacy
- kept OpenSearch 3; kept Elasticsearch 7 as legacy for older projects
- reworked PHP images (8.3/8.4/8.5): consolidated layers, removed deprecated
  libmcrypt, disabled OPcache JIT for stability, switched Xdebug to trigger-based
  (no autostart) with no hardcoded IDE key
- standardized PHP 8.3/8.4/8.5 Dockerfiles on one shared pattern
- removed PHP 7.4, 8.1 and 8.2 images; only the latest three PHP versions ship
- defaulted compose services to ivankodev/* images from Docker Hub
- fixed example.conf upstream (php82 -> php85)
- ignored .vscode; stopped tracking www/log/autohost.error.log
